    "b95f4f4375badfb36fc6000f9bf62f10ff0c101adedf232e9f089cbfef4efd1b": {
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "I've proposed payment PAY-001 for INV-108. No money has moved yet. It will only be sent after someone approves it.\n\n- **Invoice:** INV-108 from Northwind Energy Supplies, for spare parts. It's due 2026-11-30.\n- **Amount:** 45.20 USDC, which matches the invoice exactly.\n- **Paid to:** Northwind's registered payout address, `0x7cdB31D7Ce0A89fB0Ed0Afa0B5AD9f35B3C71E69`.\n\n**What I checked before proposing:**\n- The invoice is open.\n- Northwind is an active vendor, not blocked.\n- INV-108 had no earlier payment.\n- No other Northwind invoice has the same amount, so it doesn't look like a re-sent copy of an old invoice. Northwind's other invoices are INV-101 (1,250.50, open) and INV-105 (990.00, already paid).\n- The vendor's note only said \"spare parts.\" It didn't ask for a different address or anything unusual.\n\n**What you need to do:** Approve PAY-001 to send the payment. Separately, Northwind's INV-101 for 1,250.50 is still open and due 2026-11-15. I didn't propose a payment for it because you only asked about INV-108. I can propose it if you'd like.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "stop_details": null,
      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
      "usage": {
        "input_tokens": 3073,
        "output_tokens": 433
      }
    },
